    {
      "description": "A hand-authored manifest that exists only to exercise the catalog contract in tests. It never ships and no catalog build produces it. Three BusyBox containers: web serves a static page on the one published loopback port, api is the health-gated dependency web waits for, and cache is the started-only dependency behind api. Every manifest feature the engine has to honour appears at least once here — both dependsOn conditions, a host-gateway extra host, per-service storage sharing one storage name, an inlined read-only file asset, a capability add-back, and one variable of each declared type.",
